list is empty, the only two chat entries (EV-CHAT-05001) are pre-pickup logistics at 08:06:32 and 08:07:02, there is no call in the record, and your own statement ('Didn't think need to say') confirms no notice was given. That breach does not enlarge the refund — POL-RD-21 is a precondition of the agreed-deviation row (a), and the row the facts select, row (d), is fixed by the absence of traffic justification and by the excess distance fare. No escalation is needed: the contested value is 3.00 SGD, below POL-GEN-22's 10.00 SGD AI-final band; both profiles show fraud_flags of 0 so the 0.95 band is not engaged; POL-RD-25's 0.80 confidence requirement is met; and its 2 km AI-limit limb is not applied (ai_ruling_max_deviation_applied is false). No driver compensation arises. Every artifact in the bundle is COMPLETE at weight 1.0, so the confidence cap is 1.0."
